{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51970","headline":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 一 · 吕岩","name":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世有学人无数，愚痴妄意如麻。\n汞铅错认结爲沙，运火欲觅黄芽。\n千日虚劳心力，人人尽破其家。\n真铅似玉本无瑕，将凤欲比狂鸦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}